WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.367
-Today is Friday,
and that's usually when

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.133
I catch up with
some personal stuff.

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.367
I check my inbox,

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.601
I return some e-mails,
and of course,

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:07.000
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.400
And I was just running
a bit behind.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:12.300
I was running a bit behind today
so if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.834
can I write out my weekly
thank-you notes

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:18.234
right now for you guys?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.234 --> 00:00:22.734
Thomas, can I get some thank-you
note-writing music, please?

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:28.601
♪♪

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:31.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:34.367
Thank you, NFL kickers,

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.167
for not being called
"football Rockettes."

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:40.267
[ Applause ]

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:41.868
Why not?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.300
Thank you, football playbooks,

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.667
for looking like a game
of drunk Tic-Tac-Toe.

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:55.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:00.734
Thank you, rakes,

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:03.701
for being outdoor brooms
with '90s boy-band hair.

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:05.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:16.033
Thank you, tennis, for teaching
me that love means nothing.

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:18.968
-Wow.

00:01:22.434 --> 00:01:25.267
Wow, dang.
Send that to yourself.

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:27.701
Yeah.
Thank yourself for that one.

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.834
It's going to fit in there.

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:31.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:38.467
-Is this real?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:40.133
-It's like a pocket square.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:44.000
Class. Yeah.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:50.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.667
[ Imitating bong ]
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:55.033
-No, it's not a bong.
It's a pipe.

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:56.200
-Oh, a pipe. Okay.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:00.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:03.167
[ Imitating pipe ]

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:04.567
[ Exhales ]

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.701
[ Imitating bong ]

00:02:08.701 --> 00:02:10.667
-That'd be a bong.

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:12.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.634 --> 00:02:13.834
Alright. Here we go.

00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:20.767
Thank you, paper clips,
for being very simple mazes.

00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:22.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:32.634
Thank you, the creator of
school buses, for being like,

00:02:32.634 --> 00:02:34.467
"I want giant tires,
a bunch of windows,

00:02:34.467 --> 00:02:36.000
and absolutely no seat belts."

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.467
There you have it, everybody.

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.467
Those are our thank-you notes.
When we come back, we're doing

00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:40.934
something fun with John Legend.

00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:42.634
Come on back with John Legend,
everybody.

